格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"English ｜ 中文","id":"gh:1338406644","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-plugin-heartbeat","slug":"LittleBlackTong/dsh-plugin-heartbeat","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"# dsh-plugin-heartbeat"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"**English** ｜ 中文"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> An autonomic heartbeat for DeepSeek Harness: it pulses in silence, reads the session's own project"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"ions, and only opens a turn when something actually changed — a report (L1), a decision question (L2"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"), or an escalation (L4). No signal, no message."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A Cordis plugin for DeepSeek Harness. v0.5 made the heartbeat *task-aware*; **v0.6.0 turns it from a"},{"id":"p4s2","text":" metronome into an autonomic nervous system**: every pulse reads the session silently, measures arou"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"sal, and speaks only when there is a reason. When there is nothing to say, the pulse is recorded in "},{"id":"p4s4","text":"its vitals and nothing is injected at all."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Heads-up: the default behaviour changed in v0.6.0"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **0.5.x**: one message every `intervalSeconds`, whether or not anything happened (the task snapsho"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"t was re-read and repeated).\n- **0.6.0**: a **silent pulse** by default — no signal, no turn, no inj"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"ected message. It speaks at L1/L2/L4 only when it detects a change worth a message (see the level ta"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"ble below).\n- The config file is now **v2**: `intervalSeconds` → `baseIntervalSeconds`, plus rhythm "},{"id":"p6s5","text":"/ quiet-hours / dedupe / budget / L3 / workspace fields. An existing v1 `heartbeat.json` is **migrat"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"ed automatically** on load — nothing to do.\n- Runtime state now lives in `<dshHome>/heartbeat-vitals"},{"id":"p6s7","text":".json` (separate from the config, so hand-editing the config never pollutes runtime state). It survi"},{"id":"p6s8","text":"ves restarts, and after a restart the plugin stays quiet for `restartCooldownSeconds` (default 5 min"},{"id":"p6s9","text":"utes) before it may speak again.\n- The settings sidebar label follows the App language — **心跳** in C"},{"id":"p6s10","text":"hinese, **Heartbeat** in English — with the same stroked-heart icon."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## How it works"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"A host-plane Cordis plugin attaches one runtime to every **root agent** (subagents are skipped), inc"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"luding sessions that already exist when the plugin is hot-mounted."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"Each pulse runs the same four steps — the plugin itself never asks an LLM to decide:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- **Sensors** (`lib/sensors.js`): synchronously read the session's public projections — `todos`, `ag"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"entTeam`, `goal`, `userQuestions`, plus `contextPressure` — and **diff them against what the last pu"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"lse saw**. Only changes become signals, each with a weight; the weights sum into an **arousal** scor"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"e (0–8). Repeating the same todo list on every beat is exactly the noise v0.6 removes.\n- **Rhythm** "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"(`lib/rhythm.js`): the next interval is `baseInterval × (1 + missed) × mood(arousal)`, clamped to 30"},{"id":"p11s6","text":" s – 24 h, where higher arousal shortens the interval (arousal 4 → one third). Quiet hours suspend p"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"ulses entirely, a refractory window enforces a minimum silence after a delivery, and a small determi"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"nistic jitter stops several sessions from firing on the same tick.\n- **Gate** (`lib/gate.js`): decid"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"es **L0 (silent) / L1 (report) / L2 (ask) / L4 (escalation)**, applies the dedupe window and the dai"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"ly budget, and refuses to speak when you just spoke, when context pressure is high, during quiet hou"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"rs, or while paused/snoozed.\n- **Action** (`lib/runtime.js`): for L1/L2/L4 it optionally compacts lo"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"ng history first, then injects one message carrying a **why-now line**, the task snapshot (when `tas"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"kNudge` is on) and a level-specific instruction. An **L0 pulse injects nothing** — it only records a"},{"id":"p11s14","text":" row in the vitals history."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Delivery mechanics (unchanged from v0.5):"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **agent idle** → a fresh turn opens immediately;\n- **agent busy** → the message parks in the `next"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"-turn` inbox and is claimed when the current turn ends — at most one pending beat, replaced in place"},{"id":"p13s3","text":" (`inbox.replace`), never stacked;\n- consecutive unanswered beats trigger a **hard stop** after `pau"},{"id":"p13s4","text":"seAfterMissed` (default 3); only a real message from you revives the heartbeat and resets its phase;"},{"id":"p13s5","text":"ssed` (default 3); only a real message from you revives the heartbeat and resets its phase;\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"## Autonomy levels (L0–L4)"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| Level | Behaviour | Default in v0.6 |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"| **L0** | Silent pulse: read, diff, record — **inject nothing** | ✅ the default for every tick with"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"out a signal |\n| **L1** | Open a turn and **report** progress / risks / blockers only | ✅ when there"},{"id":"p16s3","text":" are progress-only signals |\n| **L2** | Open a turn and **ask** (`ask_user_question`) whether to act"},{"id":"p16s4","text":" / which option | ✅ when a decision-bearing signal appears |\n| **L3** | Within **granted categories*"},{"id":"p16s5","text":"*, proceed without asking first | ⛔ **off by default** (`l3Allow: []`); instruction-level authorizat"},{"id":"p16s6","text":"ion only |\n| **L4** | Same ask as L2 but with **escalated wording** when a decision signal has alrea"},{"id":"p16s7","text":"dy gone unanswered (`missed ≥ 2`) — frequency never increases | ✅ |"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Version requirements"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"- **DSH: official 0.2.1-rc.5 series.** `package.json` declares `engines.dsh: \"^0.2.1-rc.5\"`; the hos"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"t gates with semver (`includePrerelease: true`), so mind prerelease semantics: `^0.2.1` / `>=0.2.0` "},{"id":"p19s3","text":"**do not match** `0.2.1-rc.5`; only `^0.2.1-rc.5` does. It also covers the eventual 0.2.1 stable, wh"},{"id":"p19s4","text":"ile `0.3.0-rc.1` is judged incompatible.\n- **session format v4** (official 0.1.7+). The heartbeat so"},{"id":"p19s5","text":"urce uses the producer-owned kind `plugin:heartbeat`; v4's native admission rejects the v3 `{kind:'p"},{"id":"p19s6","text":"lugin', plugin:'heartbeat'}` wrapper. The v4 and v3 allowlists are mutually exclusive.\n- **0.4.2 is "},{"id":"p19s7","text":"the last v3-compatible version**; **from 0.5.0 the plugin supports only the official DSH 0.2.1-rc.5 "},{"id":"p19s8","text":"series**. 0.3.x is not supported yet.\n- **Use 0.8.0**: the published 0.6.1 misreads session projecti"},{"id":"p19s9","text":"ons — `stateOf()` returns raw state, so the `subagent` identity `{}` was treated as \"this is a subag"},{"id":"p19s10","text":"ent\" and **no heartbeat attached at all**, while the child-active gate never fired; 0.6.2 fixed that"},{"id":"p19s11","text":", 0.7.0 added speech-right arbitration, the physiology line and the child-activity pill, and 0.8.0 a"},{"id":"p19s12","text":"dds the diagnostics panel, panel controls for the arbitration/physiology keys and a lighter activity"},{"id":"p19s13","text":" pill.\n- **Verified on a real host** (DSH Desktop 0.2.1-rc.5, v0.6.0 build loaded after restart):\n- "},{"id":"p19s14","text":"`GET /api/heartbeat/status` → 200 with both live sessions (`sessionId` / `cwd` / `nextBeatAt` / budg"},{"id":"p19s15","text":"et / history), and `/api/heartbeat/config` returns the **v2** config;\n- an existing v1 `heartbeat.js"},{"id":"p19s16","text":"on` was migrated automatically (`intervalSeconds` → `baseIntervalSeconds`, plus the new mode / quiet"},{"id":"p19s17","text":"-hours / budget fields) and `heartbeat-vitals.json` was created;\n- **silent pulses work**: with the "},{"id":"p19s18","text":"interval temporarily at 60 s, both sessions recorded an `L0 · no new signal · delivered: false` vita"},{"id":"p19s19","text":"ls row while the daily budget stayed at 0 (zero injections); the 600 s / jitter 60 s config was rest"},{"id":"p19s20","text":"ored afterwards;\n- **hot-plug**: `dsh plugin remove` while running turned `/status` from 200 into 40"},{"id":"p19s21","text":"1 (route gone, no crash), and `add` brought it back to 200 with the session restored;\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}

